w:Near _ Ban-bridge Town, in the Coun-ty Down One _ morn-ing _ in _ Ju-
"G" G6EG | "Am" A2 A2 "F" A2 GA | "C" c2 c2 "G" d2cd | "Am" e2 dc "F" A2 G2 |
w:ly, Down _ the bor-een came a sweet col-leen, And she smiled as she passed me
